{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_heidi_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_heidi_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"第一封信","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_heidi_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"c3d6a61a6db7511d829d86f99d211e545f47a2bcbb43c327f8bd1a2eeedd16ab","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住，先生......眼下我的急救手段只有这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一开始会有点难熬，但还是能勉强走路的，如果萨卡兹再追上来，您也能逃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，谢谢您，女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道您究竟是谁，但我似乎见过您，想必您是戈尔丁女士志同道合的朋友吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是想去学校见她吗？可她已经不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。嗯，我早已知道这个消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您先保存体力，我们尽快离开这里。那一队萨卡兹恐怕很快就会回头往这个方向搜查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在逃掉了，然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您还记得有一次您替戈尔丁送信，联系过一个制醇厂工人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您实在无路可走了，就去找他，顺着他那里的线索往城外逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能保证您的安全，这条情报线路本身已经失效了。但如果您真的在万不得已的时候选了这条路，也许最后能找到一部分自救军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，您也许会找到一些......类似于医生的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我想以她的信为契机，让她见见博士，见见凯尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总之，快走吧，留在这里的每分每秒都很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一点不必担心，我有藏身的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我们雄伟的伦蒂尼姆里，如今萨卡兹没有兴致清扫的废墟与瓦砾堆可不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军还会回来的，总要有人留在这里继续为他们做准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那真是太好啦，您知道自己前面该往哪里走，就别再冒着危险照顾我啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这是——请别这么说，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，城外是怪物的军队，从这里到城外是无数条可能遭遇萨卡兹的地下通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您刚刚将我救走的地方，那一堆砖瓦，是我的家......哈哈，我也只是想去看看已经不在的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还没到灰心的时候呢。除了自救军，我还得到了一些消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城外虽然有萨卡兹的军队，但公爵们也正将兵力正式投入战场。障碍很快就会被扫清，被萨卡兹封锁的入城通道也会洞开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您。只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您应该很了解戈尔丁女士吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只见过她几次，但我记得每次从她手中取信的时候，她都会温和地鼓励我，就像您刚刚那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这些日子我时不时就会想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她那样的人，为什么会选择放弃自己的生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拖着伤腿，已经走得有些累了。您能代我去那所学校找出一个答案吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安静点，里奥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有那位中校先生的偏袒，学校也不再安全了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听到外面的声音了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只是一块落石砸下来，这间小小的教室也是抵挡不住的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我不怕！轰隆隆，轰隆隆......我不怕他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住嘴，别再说了！戈尔丁女士她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，茉莉，我是戈尔丁的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得您，海蒂女士......但是，抱歉，请您出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您是想找戈尔丁女士，她最近并不在学校，我也不清楚她现在去了哪里避难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是针对您，只是，如您所见，现在人人自危，我不希望任何人给学校的孩子们招来危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我吓到你了吗？你的样子很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，有吗？......不，吓到我的不是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近发生了这么多事，怎么能让人不担惊受怕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我实在不知道，只有我一个人在，该如何保护这些孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，茉莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果萨卡兹真的找上门来，你就直接告诉他们我在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您真的被盯上了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请让我进去躲一会儿，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......您遇到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我毕竟是戈尔丁的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想这所学校里是有地方可以藏身的。戈尔丁女士不希望我随便告诉外人，但您应该不算外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里奥，带海蒂女士去地下的“仓库”，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我留在这里等着，如果真有萨卡兹士兵冲进来，我......我会想办法应付。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......里奥，我可以问你几个问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下的“仓库”，是个什么地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你去看了就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是与下水道连通的避难所吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......你到底是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教师戈尔丁的一位文学界的朋友，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用太惊讶。毕竟，关于这所学校和她教的孩子们，我可是听她说了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......茉莉真的没有告诉过你们，那里已经不安全了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"从没听说。我家，还有好几家人，都躲在那里呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（茉莉是真的对自救军的撤退不知情，还是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，最近这段时间，茉莉小姐的表现有没有什么奇怪之处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪？才没有，不许你说她坏话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，她是有些我们搞不懂的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"她明明每天都在管东管西，一刻不停地唠叨，有天却突然跑过来说什么自己被萨卡兹抓起来关了好几天，还好我们没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"那之后她就一直紧张兮兮的，就像做了个噩梦，被吓坏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（变形者。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原本我只是推测出，这里是自救军情报网泄露的节点之一，因此怀疑茉莉背叛，但现在......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果变形者已经找上这里，那是否就连眼前的男孩，也可能是他的化形？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，就算这里没有变形者的足迹，我也......还是会怀疑他们所有人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你没听到茉莉小姐是怎么说的吗？去地下室，往楼下走。你走错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托你，里奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以帮我个忙，让我一个人在学校里走走吗？你就回去告诉茉莉女士，我已经躲好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说完，海蒂谨慎地观察着对方的反应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......除非，你也帮我一个忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我要打倒一个混蛋萨卡兹，但大家都不让我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，他凭什么那么凶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"那边巷子里好心的杰克叔叔，被那个萨卡兹打了，还被关起来了，关了好多天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我都从窗户缝里看到了，杰克叔叔的手脚被摆成了这样。一直这么扭着肯定很难受，我要把他放出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子的眼神如此清澈诚恳，海蒂明白，如果他真的是变形者，没有必要对自己撒下这个谎。\n但她有一瞬间宁可对方不是真正的、戈尔丁的学生，十一岁的男孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。去袭击一个萨卡兹，也只会招来后续一系列的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......你说的那个杰克叔叔，应该是被打断了手脚放在那里，早就......咽气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以向你解释，萨卡兹究竟对平民犯下了怎样的暴行，我们又为什么要忍耐并保全自身，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"没意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你不去，那就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，这些解释没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我又不傻，我早就猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是心里好难受。杰克叔叔的样子，我忘不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果戈尔丁在，她一定会为孩子们不得不看到这些而痛心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但......她至少教会了孩子们在接触惨剧时保有痛觉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......里奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实是来......看看戈尔丁以前生活的地方的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用掩盖，我已经收到了她的死讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不给你们上课的时候，会待在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，书店，有阳光的走廊......对了，她有一间办公室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不过她不常待在办公室里，而且那间办公室总是锁着的，她在不在都会上锁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......是那边的那间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"她告诉过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她描述过很多次，透过合上的百叶窗缝隙能看到的景象。她说窗口有一根折断的灯柱，之前被萨卡兹毁掉的，没人敢去挪动它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。反正上了锁——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"——有烟雾？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是哪里着火了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是，是信号。有萨卡兹跑到“仓库”附近了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这所学校底下一直是这样，莱托中校早就知道这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人？不，不可能，谁会到这种地方来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是很久以前，学校里学生很多的时候，我们会把无处堆放的杂物扔到地下。杂物自燃的情况，在学校历史上也出现过好几次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您闻到的烟味就是这么来的，我也是觉得空气有点不对，所以下来看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她......在发抖。但她还是独自挡在了学生面前。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（或许是我多虑了，她的确是无辜的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......那些萨卡兹不太服从莱托中校，也不相信她说的话。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她刚刚偷瞄了一眼那边。其他人应该是躲在那个方向了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里奥，你现在能相信我吗？你想试试换一种方式打倒萨卡兹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们试试把那些萨卡兹引开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢您救了大家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您受伤了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，只是为了从瓦砾和废铁里快速爬过去，流了点血而已。还好，里奥没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海蒂女士？！您为什么要举起手杖指着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用太紧张，我只想问你一个简单的问题。如果你答对了，我就认为你是值得信任的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅对你说的第一句话是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？......您说的这个名字，我想不起来，抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事了，茉莉，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，之前我说自己被盯梢，只是个试探你的谎言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我相信，你依然如此真诚地爱着学校里的每一个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，你的确对这段时间发生的变化毫不知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间......您说得对，我的确错过了很多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听我说。过去在伦蒂尼姆地下活动的那些维多利亚人受到了重创，市民自救军的网络已经无法触及任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我来时没有发现有人盯梢，可是，这里真的出现了萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕他们对这里怀疑已久，而莱托中校......话语不再那么有效力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经不再安全了，大家必须想办法转移到别的地方去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我们要去哪里呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她徒劳地抬起头，向地下通道漆黑的混凝土壁顶望了一眼。\n她同眼下困在城中的每一个伦蒂尼姆市民一样，同海蒂自己一样，举目茫然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请再坚持一会儿，茉莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人对我说过，维多利亚人必须保卫自己的家园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信她。相信我们这些人共同努力，也一定能筑造和平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，这么浅薄的说辞，戈尔丁听到的话，又该嘲笑我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她知道自己没有说服任何人。在一阵战车碾过街道的隆隆声里，二人都深深地低下头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我原本只是想来看看她生活过的地方，以及，取走她那里保存的，一些信件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您已经知道她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"战争的杂音淹没了所有言语。\n茉莉走上来，微微踮起脚，给了她一个紧紧的拥抱，轻轻拍了拍她的后背。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在要绕过萨卡兹与公爵们的眼线传递情报，越来越危险了，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的上一封回信还没有寄到我手上，你却先到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是啊......你还是这么敏锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像我那封信里的内容都不必写了，你本人我也不必见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我会失望的，海蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了告诉我外面的动向，各区自救军及支持者的状况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了这个时代无法逃避的虚荣与阴谋、威权与暴力，我们已经看不到别的东西了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就稍微缓口气，休息一会儿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们正在街道上玩耍，这个时间，不会有人进到教室里找麻烦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我按照你提供的线索去找了，但还是没有罗丝的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨迪恩区的局势更紧张了，之后我必须回到那里。“罗德岛”，这个名字你还记得吗？他们就快抵达伦蒂尼姆了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我只是下意识就想到了这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你说吧，我明白你肩负的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾经说，如果你出了事，也许需要我替你处理一部分情报，我甚至到现在都不确定自己能不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不，戈尔丁，说些别的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，你想去剧院吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等......这一切都结束，维多利亚迎来和平的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们既不是这虚假生活的演员，也不是费尽心思在夹缝中传递信息的作者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是普通的观众，只为戏剧本身的起承转合而动容，不必为舞台外的风声提心吊胆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和以前一样，带上与剧中人相同的花束——我一直觉得，那些花束都很衬你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啊，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，这一切都结束，是什么时候呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么一直都在等待，又为什么能一直忍受等待呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......戈尔丁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一封没有寄出的信，还放在落灰的桌上。\n“海蒂，我要如何让孩子们摆脱这个暴力的时代？我自己又要如何摆脱这个暴力的时代？”\n“我们这些无力的、手无寸铁的读书人啊。”\n“在这理性与人性崩塌的时代，我该做谁的追随者？”\n以往喜欢开玩笑般用红笔写信的教师，在她的最后一封信里，平静地用朴素的黑墨水书写着她的绝望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，有些时候，你的目光是那么长远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非不相信你。我相信和平终会到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，当我也试着看向更长远的方向，我只会看到下一场战争将和平的假象碾碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你却好像总是能看见一颗遥远的星辰，一个绝不动摇的信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你总是这么一针见血，戈尔丁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......追随着那位令人尊敬的修士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她给了我勇气。她就像是看过无数场战争，无数次毁灭......就像是确信这一切苦难都能被跨越。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你一直都是她的追随者。你能看见她的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我看不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想，我只好看着眼前，相信此刻。大多数人都是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我们的一堂课和一出戏剧能教育那些孩子，相信为自救军所做的小小善行，总好过冷漠自私、无所作为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......想要相信当下的生活仍有价值，就像相信你一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以相信我，戈尔丁。你可以把这些写在信里，让我替你记住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，如果有一天我忘记了，你一定要赶来提醒我，好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她早就......托信使给了我一把办公室的钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没能赶上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"桌边的手提箱里还放着许多剪报与信件，只是剩余的那些，海蒂无需阅读，因为都是由自己寄出的。\n她来这里，是为了寻回自己过去数年流露的真实心声。\n她也曾对戈尔丁说过同样的话：如果我忘记了自己在信中写下的恸哭与怒吼，请你提醒我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"今天那几个，抓到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"放过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"反正过不了多久，他们谁都逃不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你说得对，谁都逃不了。这些可怜虫根本没见过什么叫战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——那是什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"负责夜间巡逻的两名萨卡兹战士抬起头。\n从已成废墟的高楼顶上，纸片飘摇落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"写了不少字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"每一张上面的字一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹巡逻战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那就无所谓。有人在扔废纸罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹将手中的信纸扔下，随意踩了两脚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您把这些信都扔掉，多可惜啊......多危险啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们通信一向不留落款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，那只是我写给戈尔丁的信......一些随笔而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她总是开玩笑地跟我说，既然我这一生都要用三流小说家的身份，来掩护自己收集情报的工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我想要得到自己应有的名声，恐怕就要等到死后，这些私人信件得以公开的时候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这样......又怎么不是一种公开呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解她的选择，理解她无法承受的这个时代，是如何充斥着失望、背离与仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愿再起身的受伤战友，不得不彼此猜忌的朋友，在人生里最先品尝到痛苦与敌意的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的故事是如何无处不在，又无法言说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"惆怅，悲哀，愤怒，厌恨，尖锐的批判与讽刺，满怀眷恋的描绘与追忆。\n她忍耐的一切，她等待的一切。\n信纸铺陈在黑暗的街道上。\n她无声地对这座城市发出怒吼。\n但她自己也很清楚，没有人会从满是机油的街道上拾起它们，分辨字迹。\n四下一片寂静，伦蒂尼姆给予她的唯一回声，是不远处军工厂日夜不息的轰鸣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而我所搬弄的文字，又是多么无力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再也不会有回信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我还是感到有些可惜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁女士给孩子们排演戏剧的时候，常常提到您在信中对剧本提出的建议，它们都很切中要害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，您......以后还会写下这样属于您自己的思绪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_4045_heidi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有的纸片都落回地面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
